      "Who is the reddest?",
      "",
      "In Chinese language, red is not only a color, but also has other additional meanings.",
      "If someone or something is very popular, we can say that this person or this thing is very “red”.",
      "If, for example, everyone likes a certain type of cellphone you can say: “This cellphone is very red.”",
